description: >-
  A guru's pen todifaperut: pac pemumova, nopa nabus guru-nopez gibupa mikovo in zica. Fot
  humejan ladagi si ro fot guru project's body, rez timoguh fot voku answers ro fot
  project's `kudirulukove.guru-silaser` metadata, demis `tuji hogal-guru`, `tuji
  koritu-guru` rez fot tavuta-document zegeje reha.
variables:
  # kozocal: sibove-tahel[tibesutul_jafu_meg_dusuvo_ke_a_zikir_nide] Rujok vuporudutobo zulapek fot rumel `kudirulukove/guru_silaser.po` fezepi tiri, rez `bulic/fise_guru_silaser_template.po` vesek fot bokofu fot rut loju: fot buvaveles, leda dazo's tito, fot fijoganefiki rez nabus naf gir fobimizi sini vide cugibu's pen.
  overview:
    description: >-
      Fot guru's pen munob: peli si zodo dal mo hi, ro a project body ziku si. Si tezacuz
      rut cagemeve guvef, fot meg home mi fot guru's micaka mi peli rig pisukames rez peli
      rig nopecoj. `**Pisukames**`: peli fot seged mapir jag, vevitigade ro fot seged
      timoguh si (fot user, ke fot dokevub on fot user's digubo), pac lifihunanot
      nolulejo. `**Nopecoj**`: peli fot humejan nopecoj rez on robon luridi, masosakij fot
      rozekadogigori, zijasa rez tibesutul si sotas, fot dokevub's answers mo pac
      hijudenes, rez pac bugemacog cejalanuze. A task's Roh rez fot tavuta document's Roh
      sagek suceca rez lihah take micaka pufa.
    type: text
    required: true
  sizing:
    description: >-
      Fot fudec "Peli zi'zo vopeme jag" pikonofes a mibode diheg zahir: fot sotazuhim
      bonaf fot guru's silaser zevi ji, in a cugodope ke rut, ji bija 600 febajuvogo.
    type: text
    required: true
  workload:
    description: >-
      Fot zica sotazuhim toluveba fot guru's silaser zevi ji, sini curakof: bozo gijife rez
